{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "There is a want of flow, and often a defect of rhythm. The meaning is sometimes obscure, and there is a greater use of apposition and more of repetition than occurs in Plato's earlier writings.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["There", " is", " a", " want", " of", " flow", ",", " and", " often", " a", " defect", " of", " rhythm", ".", " The", " meaning", " is", " sometimes", " obscure", ",", " and", " there", " is", " a", " greater", " use", " of", " app", "osition", " and", " more", " of", " repetition", " than", " occurs", " in", " Plato", "'s", " earlier", " writings", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
